9">La</span> <span begin="14.799" end="14.913">la</span> <span begin="14.913" end="15.001">la</span> <span begin="15.001" end="15.213">la</span> <span begin="15.213" end="15.407">la</span> <span begin="15.407" end="15.749">la</span> <span begin="15.749" end="16.035">la</span> <span begin="16.035" end="16.247">la</span> <span begin="16.247" end="16.466">la</span></p><p begin="16.466" end="18.159" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="16.466" end="16.590">La</span> <span begin="16.590" end="16.675">la</span> <span begin="16.675" end="16.853">la</span> <span begin="16.853" end="17.063">la</span> <span begin="17.063" end="17.313">la</span> <span begin="17.313" end="17.420">la</span> <span begin="17.420" end="17.739">la</span> <span begin="17.739" end="17.952">la</span> <span begin="17.952" end="18.159">la</span></p><p begin="18.159" end="19.844" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="18.159" end="18.276">La</span> <span begin="18.276" end="18.361">la</span> <span begin="18.361" end="18.570">la</span> <span begin="18.570" end="18.769">la</span> <span begin="18.769" end="19.089">la</span> <span begin="19.089" end="19.407">la</span> <span begin="19.407" end="19.605">la</span> <span begin="19.605" end="19.844">la</span></p><p begin="19.844" end="21.048" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="19.844" end="19.942">La</span> <span begin="19.942" end="20.035">la</span> <span begin="20.035" end="20.218">la</span> <span begin="20.218" end="20.454">la</span> <span begin="20.454" end="20.666">la</span> <span begin="20.666" end="20.765">la</span> <span begin="20.765" end="21.048">la</span></p><p begin="21.473" end="24.514" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.473" end="21.717" amll:empty-beat="1">光</span><span begin="21.717" end="21.920">り</span><span begin="21.920" end="22.236" amll:empty-beat="2">輝</span><span begin="22.236" end="22.341">い</span><span begin="22.341" end="22.459">て</span><span begin="22.459" end="22.536">見</span><span begin="22.536" end="22.757">え</span><span begin="22.757" end="22.823">た</span><span begin="22.823" end="22.944">世</span><span begin="22.944" end="23.783" amll:empty-beat="1">界</span><span begin="23.783" end="24.514">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">【一歌】那看似熠熠生辉的世界 / This world that seemed to glittering brightly</span></p><p begin="24.804" end="27.500" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="24.804" end="24.919">そ</span><span begin="24.919" end="25.040">の</span><span begin="25.040" end="25.244" amll:empty-beat="1">何</span><span begin="25.244" end="25.454">十</span><span begin="25.454" end="25.682">倍</span><span begin="25.682" end="25.778">も</span><span begin="25.778" end="26.433" amll:empty-beat="2">輝</span><span begin="26.433" end="26.506">い</span><span begin="26.506" end="26.603">て</span><span begin="26.603" end="27.500">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">实际比想象中的还要绚烂几十倍 / It was shining dozens of times brighter</span></p><p begin="27.787" end="31.202" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="27.787" end="28.297" amll:empty-beat="2">｢私､</span><span begin="28.297" end="28.602">こ</span><span begin="28.602" end="28.841">こ</span><span begin="28.841" end="29.206">で</span><span begin="29.206" end="29.697" amll:empty-beat="1">光</span><span begin="29.697" end="29.880">れ</span><span begin="29.880" end="29.925">る</span><span begin="29.925" end="30.190">の</span><span begin="30.190" end="30.281">か</span><span begin="30.281" end="30.499">な｣っ</span><span begin="30.499" end="31.202">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“我...能在这里发光吗”怀着这样的忐忑 / &quot;I wonder if I can shine in this place?&quot;</span></p><p begin="31.546" end="34.631" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="31.546" end="31.661">た</span><span begin="31.661" end="31.768">く</span><span begin="31.768" end="31.977" amll:empty-beat="1">さん</span><span begin="31.977" end="32.176">の</span><span begin="32.176" end="32.405" amll:empty-beat="1">愛</span><span begin="32.405" end="32.515">で</span><span begin="32.515" end="32.723">鳴っ</span><span begin="32.723" end="32.817">た</span><span begin="32.817" end="33.142" amll:empty-beat="1">音</span><span begin="33.142" end="33.243">を</span><span begin="33.243" end="33.371">た</span><span begin="33.371" end="33.554">だ</span><span begin="33.554" end="33.850">辿っ</span><span begin="33.850" end="34.631">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我只是循着由无数爱奏响的旋律前行着 / I say while simply following the sound that ring out with so much love</span></p><p begin="34.920" end="37.941" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="34.920" end="35.029">い</span><span begin="35.029" end="35.138">つ</span><span begin="35.138" end="35.360">の</span><span begin="35.360" end="35.469">間</span><span begin="35.469" end="35.558">に</span><span begin="35.558" end="35.768">か</span><span begin="35.768" end="35.899">変</span><span begin="35.899" end="35.979">わ</span><span begin="35.979" end="36.179">る</span><span begin="36.179" end="36.358">景</span><span begin="36.358" end="37.241" amll:empty-beat="1">色</span><span begin="37.241" end="37.941">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">【MEIKO】不觉间流转的景色中 / Within this scenery that changes while everyone is unaware</span></p><p begin="38.290" end="39.430" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="38.290" end="38.461" amll:empty-beat="1">楽</span><span begin="38.461" end="38.586">し</span><span begin="38.586" end="38.719">いっ</span><span begin="38.719" end="38.807">て</span><span begin="38.807" end="38.926" amll:empty-beat="1">上</span><span begin="38.926" end="39.131">がっ</span><span begin="39.131" end="39.225">た</span><span begin="39.225" end="39.430">り</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">【咲希】时而因为欢欣而雀跃 / I was elated and happy</span></p><p begin="39.553" end="41.039" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="39.553" end="39.721" amll:empty-beat="1">苦</span><span begin="39.721" end="39.914">し</span><span begin="39.914" end="39.994">いっ</span><span begin="39.994" end="40.075">て</span><span begin="40.075" end="40.196">悩</span><span begin="40.196" end="40.369">ん</span><span begin="40.369" end="40.585">だ</span><span begin="40.585" end="41.039">り</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">【穂波】时而因为苦闷而辗转 / then distressed and worried</span></p><p begin="41.232" end="42.447" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.232" end="41.438">いっ</span><span begin="41.438" end="41.553">ぱ</span><span begin="41.553" end="41.653">い</span><span begin="41.653" end="41.760">受</span><span begin="41.760" end="42.055">け</span><span begin="42.055" end="42.152">取</span><span begin="42.152" end="42.281">っ</span><span begin="42.281" end="42.447">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">【志歩】将万千感受尽数接纳 / Taking all of that in</span></p><p begin="42.624" end="44.300" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.624" end="43.075" amll:empty-beat="1">一</span><span begin="43.075" end="43.332">つ</span><span begin="43.332" end="43.604" amll:empty-beat="1">歌</span><span begin="43.604" end="43.674">に</span><span begin="43.674" end="43.874">し</span><span begin="43.874" end="44.300">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">【一歌】融汇成一首歌 / I put it into a song</span></p><p begin="44.519" end="47.011" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.519" end="44.733">そう</span><span begin="44.733" end="44.994">やっ</span><span begin="44.994" end="45.057">て</span><span begin="45.057" end="45.208">こ</span><span begin="45.208" end="45.382">ん</span><span begin="45.382" end="45.574">な</span><span begin="45.574" end="45.935" amll:empty-beat="1">強</span><span begin="45.935" end="46.247">く</span><span begin="46.247" end="46.477">な</span><span begin="46.477" end="46.670">れ</span><span begin="46.670" end="46.792">た</span><span begin="46.792" end="47.011">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就这样淬炼出如今的坚强 / And I became so strong because of that</span></p><p begin="47.167" end="47.693" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="47.167" end="47.321">I</span> <span begin="47.321" end="47.507">need</span> <span begin="47.507" end="47.693">you！</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">【MEIKO】“我需要你！” /</span></p><p begin="47.735" end="50.992" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="47.735" end="47.930">こん</span><span begin="47.930" end="48.139">な</span> <span begin="48.139" end="48.545">気</span><span begin="48.739" end="48.946">持</span><span begin="48.946" end="49.307">ち</span> <span begin="49.366" end="49.673" amll:empty-beat="1">初</span><span begin="49.848" end="50.040">め</span><span begin="50.040" end="50.170">て</span><span begin="50.170" end="50.456" amll:empty-beat="1">味</span><span begin="50.456" end="50.667">わ</span><span begin="50.667" end="50.992">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这样的心情 还是初次体会到 / I taste such a feeling for the first time</span></p><p begin="51.293" end="54.344" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="51.293" end="51.504">見</span><span begin="51.504" end="51.714">て</span><span begin="51.714" end="51.790">い</span><span begin="51.790" end="51.940">た</span><span begin="52.092" end="52.339">も</span><span begin="52.339" end="52.575">の</span><span begin="52.575" end="52.769">が</span><span begin="52.769" end="52.986">見</span><span begin="52.986" end="53.198">ら</span><span begin="53.198" end="53.414">れ</span><span begin="53.414" end="53.464">る</span><span begin="53.464" end="53.823">も</span><span begin="53.823" end="54.034">の</span><span begin="54.034" end="54.344">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">【一歌】从“被看见的风景”变成了“能被别人看见的存在” / The things I was seeing are the things I can see</span></p><p begin="54.815" end="57.689" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="54.815" end="55.176" amll:empty-beat="1">一</span><span begin="55.494" end="55.881">人</span> <span begin="55.920" end="56.029">な</span><span begin="56.029" end="56.235">の</span><span begin="56.235" end="56.431">に</span> <span begin="56.431" end="56.679" amll:empty-beat="1">独</span><span begin="56.753" end="56.852">り</span><span begin="56.852" end="57.180">じゃ</span><span begin="57.180" end="57.385">な</span><span begin="57.385" end="57.689">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">【MEIKO】虽孑然一身却不觉得孤独 / We&apos;re on our own but we are not alone</span></p><p begin="58.010" end="58.393" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="58.010" end="58.231" amll:empty-beat="1">波</span><span begin="58.231" end="58.393">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">【穂波】让我们 / Let&apos;s walk</span></p><p begin="58.393" end="58.822" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="58.393" end="58.646" amll:empty-beat="1">上</span><span begin="58.646" end="58.822">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">【MEIKO】踏浪 / upon</span></p><p begin="58.822" end="59.226" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="58.822" end="59.070" amll:empty-beat="1">歩</span><span begin="59.070" end="59.226">こう</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">【志歩】前行 / the waves</span></p><p begin="59.226" end="1:00.300" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="59.269" end="59.375">希</span><span begin="59.375" end="59.665" amll:empty-beat="1">望</span><span begin="59.665" end="59.852">持っ</span><span begin="59.852" end="1:00.300">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">【咲希】怀抱希望 / while holding our hopes</span></p><p begin="1:00.505" end="1:03.394" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:00.505" end="1:00.723">ど</span><span begin="1:00.723" end="1:00.959">こ</span><span begin="1:00.959" end="1:01.055">ま</span><span begin="1:01.055" end="1:01.379">で</span><span begin="1:01.379" end="1:01.531">も</span><span begin="1:01.531" end="1:01.773">行</span><span begin="1:01.773" end="1:01.943">こ</span><span begin="1:01.943" end="1:03.394">う！</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">【全员】奔向无尽的远方！ / And go, no matter where to!</span></p><p begin="1:04.692" end="1:07.703" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:04.692" end="1:05.158" amll:empty-beat="1">繋</span><span begin="1:05.158" end="1:05.261">が</span><span begin="1:05.261" end="1:05.436">り</span><span begin="1:05.514" end="1:05.976" amll:empty-beat="1">続</span><span begin="1:05.976" end="1:06.099">け</span><span begin="1:06.099" end="1:06.393">る</span><span begin="1:06.393" end="1:06.605">こ</span><span begin="1:06.605" end="1:06.786">の</span><span begin="1:06.786" end="1:06.919">セ</span><span begin="1:06.919" end="1:07.228">カ</span><span begin="1:07.228" end="1:07.405">イ</span><span begin="1:07.405" end="1:07.703">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">【一歌】在这永恒相连的SEKAI里 / In this SEKAI that continues to be connected to me</span></p><p begin="1:08.073" end="1:11.113" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:08.073" end="1:08.596" amll:empty-beat="2">私</span><span begin="1:08.596" end="1:08.820">は</span><span begin="1:08.820" end="1:09.356" amll:empty-beat="1">救</span><span begin="1:09.356" end="1:09.474">わ</span><span begin="1:09.474" end="1:09.683">れ</span> <span begin="1:09.683" end="1:10.041" amll:empty-beat="1">救</span><span begin="1:10.041" end="1:10.175">っ</span><span begin="1:10.175" end="1:10.293" amll:empty-beat="1">てい</span><span begin="1:10.293" end="1:10.500">た</span><span begin="1:10.500" end="1:10.557">み</span><span begin="1:10.557" end="1:10.806" amll:empty-beat="1">たい</span><span begin="1:10.806" end="1:11.113">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我似乎既被拯救 同时也在拯救他人 / I was saved, it was like it saved me</span></p><p begin="1:11.441" end="1:11.993" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:11.441" end="1:11.648" amll:empty-beat="1">絡</span><span begin="1:11.648" end="1:11.823" amll:empty-beat="1">まっ</span><span begin="1:11.823" end="1:11.991">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">【志歩】就算彼此纠缠 / Though it is tangled up</span></p><p begin="1:12.012" end="1:12.595" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:12.012" end="1:12.276" amll:empty-beat="1">塞</span><span begin="1:12.276" end="1:12.473" amll:empty-beat="1">がっ</span><span begin="1:12.473" end="1:12.595">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">【咲希】被阻塞 / Blocked</span></p><p begin="1:12.700" end="1:13.228" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:12.700" end="1:12.811">揺</span><span begin="1:12.811" end="1:12.923">れ</span><span begin="1:12.923" end="1:13.124">たっ</span><span begin="1:13.124" end="1:13.228">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">【穂波】被动摇 / And shaken up</span></p><p begin="1:13.290" end="1:14.543" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:13.290" end="1:13.543" amll:empty-beat="1">何</span><span begin="1:13.543" end="1:13.658">度</span><span begin="1:13.658" end="1:13.734">も</span><span begin="1:13.734" end="1:13.968" amll:empty-beat="1">広</span><span begin="1:13.968" end="1:14.177">がっ</span><span begin="1:14.177" end="1:14.543">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">【MEIKO】仍无数次将心扉敞开 / it spreads again and again</span></p><p begin="1:14.770" end="1:17.883" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:14.770" end="1:15.213">&quot;伝</span><span begin="1:15.213" end="1:15.315">わ</span><span begin="1:15.315" end="1:15.625">る</span><span begin="1:15.625" end="1:15.833">こ</span><span begin="1:15.833" end="1:16.027">と&quot;</span><span begin="1:16.027" end="1:16.169" amll:empty-beat="1">って</span><span begin="1:16.169" end="1:16.456" amll:empty-beat="1">なん</span><span begin="1:16.456" end="1:16.563">て</span><span begin="1:16.563" end="1:16.959" amll:empty-beat="2">美</span><span begin="1:16.959" end="1:17.075">し</span><span begin="1:17.075" end="1:17.326" amll:empty-beat="1">いん</span><span begin="1:17.326" end="1:17.550">だ</span><span begin="1:17.550" end="1:17.883" amll:empty-beat="1">ろう</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">【一歌】“心意相通”这样的事 是多么美好啊 / &quot;What we transmit&quot; is so beautiful, don&apos;t you think?</span></p><p begin="1:18.139" end="1:21.258" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:18.139" end="1:18.527" amll:empty-beat="1">今</span><span begin="1:18.527" end="1:18.698">は</span><span begin="1:18.698" end="1:18.999">ま</span><span begin="1:18.999" end="1:19.181">だ</span><span begin="1:19.181" end="1:19.383">ちょっ</span><span begin="1:19.383" end="1:19.525">と</span><span begin="1:19.525" end="1:19.807">し</span><span begin="1:19.807" end="1:19.968">か</span><span begin="1:19.968" end="1:20.073">見</span><span begin="1:20.073" end="1:20.230">え</span><span begin="1:20.230" end="1:20.351">な</span><span begin="1:20.351" end="1:20.659">く</span><span begin="1:20.659" end="1:20.870">て</span><span begin="1:20.870" end="1:21.258">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算现在还只能看到一点点 / Though I still can only see a little ahead in this moment</span></p><p begin="1:21.498" end="1:24.475" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:21.498" end="1:22.038" amll:empty-beat="2">私</span><span begin="1:22.038" end="1:22.319">は</span><span begin="1:22.319" end="1:22.759" amll:empty-beat="1">息</span><span begin="1:22.759" end="1:22.839">を</span><span begin="1:22.839" end="1:23.191">吸っ</span><span begin="1:23.191" end="1:23.390">て</span><span begin="1:23.390" end="1:23.516" amll:empty-beat="1">歩</span><span begin="1:23.516" end="1:23.607">い</span><span begin="1:23.607" end="1:23.759">て</span><span begin="1:23.759" end="1:23.880">い</span><span begin="1:23.880" end="1:24.031">く､</span><span begin="1:24.031" end="1:24.234">きっ</span><span begin="1:24.234" end="1:24.475">と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我也一定会呼吸着 继续前行 / I&apos;ll take in a breath and walk forward, and I&apos;m sure that</span></p><p begin="1:24.876" end="1:25.401" itunes:key="L41" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:24.876" end="1:24.946">泣</span><span begin="1:24.946" end="1:25.059">い</span><span begin="1:25.059" end="1:25.265">たっ</span><span begin="1:25.265" end="1:25.401">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">【穂波】哪怕哭泣 / I&apos;ll cry</span></p><p begin="1:25.401" end="1:26.009" itunes:key="L42" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:25.401" end="1:25.614" amll:empty-beat="1">笑</span><span begin="1:25.614" end="1:25.692">っ</span><span begin="1:25.692" end="1:25.906">たっ</span><span begin="1:25.906" end="1:26.009">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">【咲希】哪怕欢笑 / Laugh</span></p><p begin="1:26.009" end="1:26.652" itunes:key="L43" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:26.009" end="1:26.246" amll:empty-beat="1">怒</span><span begin="1:26.246" end="1:26.327">っ</span><span begin="1:26.327" end="1:26.503">たっ</span><span begin="1:26.503" end="1:26.652">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">【志歩】哪怕愤怒 / And get angry</span></p><p begin="1:26.652" end="1:27.775" itunes:key="L44" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:26.652" end="1:26.976">最</span><span begin="1:26.976" end="1:27.066">後</span><span begin="1:27.066" end="1:27.176">は</span><span begin="1:27.176" end="1:27.390" amll:empty-beat="2">喜</span><span begin="1:27.390" end="1:27.595">ん</span><span begin="1:27.595" end="1:27.775">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">【MEIKO】最后都会迎来喜悦 / But I&apos;ll be satisfied in the end</span></p><p begin="1:28.229" end="1:30.398" itunes:key="L45" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:28.229" end="1:28.412">こ</span><span begin="1:28.412" end="1:28.616">れ</span><span begin="1:28.616" end="1:28.752">か</span><span begin="1:28.752" end="1:29.067">ら</span><span begin="1:29.067" end="1:29.175">の</span><span begin="1:29.175" end="1:29.545" amll:empty-beat="1">音</span><span begin="1:29.545" end="1:29.914">を</span><span begin="1:29.914" end="1:30.084">ま</span><span begin="1:30.084" end="1:30.398">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">【一歌】然后继续去编织 / Let&apos;s continue</span></p><p begin="1:30.441" end="1:33.239" itunes:key="L46" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:30.441" end="1:31.210" amll:empty-beat="1">紡</span><span begin="1:31.210" end="1:31.373">い</span><span begin="1:31.373" end="1:31.536" amll:empty-beat="1">でい</span><span begin="1:31.536" end="1:31.745">こ</span><span begin="1:31.745" end="1:33.239">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">【全员】属于未来的旋律 / To create</span></p><p begin="1:45.412" end="1:48.467" itunes:key="L47" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:45.412" end="1:45.651" amll:empty-beat="1">光</span><span begin="1:45.651" end="1:45.823">り</span><span begin="1:45.823" end="1:46.114" amll:empty-beat="2">輝</span><span begin="1:46.114" end="1:46.280">い</span><span begin="1:46.280" end="1:46.419">て</span><span begin="1:46.419" end="1:46.499">見</span><span begin="1:46.499" end="1:46.678">え</span><span begin="1:46.678" end="1:46.748">た</span><span begin="1:46.748" end="1:46.884">セ</span><span begin="1:46.884" end="1:47.545">カ</span><span begin="1:47.545" end="1:47.759">イ</span><span begin="1:47.759" end="1:48.467">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">【一歌】在流光溢彩的SEKAI里 / The sound of the future in this SEKAI that seems to shine so brightly</span></p><p begin="1:48.779" end="1:51.427" itunes:key="L48" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:48.779" end="1:48.950" amll:empty-beat="1">一</span><span begin="1:48.950" end="1:49.218">つ</span><span begin="1:49.218" end="1:49.330">で</span><span begin="1:49.330" end="1:49.443">は</span><span begin="1:49.443" end="1:49.626" amll:empty-beat="1">ない</span> <span begin="1:49.626" end="1:49.744">た</span><span begin="1:49.744" end="1:49.809">く</span><span begin="1:49.809" end="1:50.040" amll:empty-beat="1">さん</span><span begin="1:50.040" end="1:50.151">の</span><span begin="1:50.151" end="1:50.445" amll:empty-beat="1">色</span><span begin="1:50.445" end="1:50.569">が</span><span begin="1:50.569" end="1:50.826" amll:empty-beat="1">集</span><span begin="1:50.892" end="1:51.015" amll:empty-beat="1">まっ</span><span begin="1:51.091" end="1:51.427">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">【MEIKO×咲希×穂波×志歩】汇聚着斑斓多彩的色泽 / There is not just one color, but multiple gathered together.</span></p><p begin="1:51.738" end="1:54.815" itunes:key="L49" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:51.738" end="1:52.121" amll:empty-beat="1">何</span><span begin="1:52.121" end="1:52.227">が</span><span begin="1:52.227" end="1:52.550" amll:empty-beat="1">何</span><span begin="1:52.550" end="1:52.769">だ</span><span begin="1:52.769" end="1:53.168">か</span><span begin="1:53.168" end="1:53.390">よ</span><span begin="1:53.390" end="1:53.623">く</span><span begin="1:53.623" end="1:53.822">わ</span><span begin="1:53.822" end="1:53.941">か</span><span begin="1:53.941" end="1:54.104">ら</span><span begin="1:54.104" end="1:54.260">な</span><span begin="1:54.260" end="1:54.439">くっ</span><span begin="1:54.439" end="1:54.815">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">【一歌】虽然曾不明白这一切究竟是什么 / I didn&apos;t really understand what was going on</span></p><p begin="1:55.016" end="1:57.487" itunes:key="L50" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:55.016" end="1:55.153">そ</span><span begin="1:55.153" end="1:55.269">れ</span><span begin="1:55.269" end="1:55.482">が</span><span begin="1:55.482" end="1:55.842" amll:empty-beat="1">楽</span><span begin="1:55.842" end="1:56.048">し</span><span begin="1:56.048" end="1:56.357">さっ</span><span begin="1:56.357" end="1:56.482">て</span><span begin="1:56.482" end="1:56.708">やっ</span><span begin="1:56.708" end="1:56.863">と</span><span begin="1:56.863" end="1:56.930">気</span><span begin="1:56.930" end="1:57.048">付</span><span begin="1:57.048" end="1:57.166">い</span><span begin="1:57.166" end="1:57.277">た</span><span begin="1:57.277" end="1:57.487">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但终于意识到 那正是快乐本身 / But I finally realized that I had fun</span></p><p begin="1:57.614" end="1:58.244" itunes:key="L51" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:57.614" end="1:57.814">All you</span> <span begin="1:57.814" end="1:58.008">Need</span> <span begin="1:58.008" end="1:58.244">is Love</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">【MEIKO】“你所要的是‘爱’呀”</span></p><p begin="1:58.244" end="2:01.561" itunes:key="L52" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:58.244" end="1:58.437">こん</span><span begin="1:58.437" end="1:58.607">な</span><span begin="1:58.607" end="1:58.949">気</span><span begin="1:59.278" end="1:59.444">持</span><span begin="1:59.444" end="1:59.860">ち</span><span begin="1:59.909" end="2:00.301" amll:empty-beat="1">何</span><span begin="2:00.301" end="2:00.532">度</span><span begin="2:00.532" end="2:00.639">で</span><span begin="2:00.639" end="2:00.745">も</span><span begin="2:00.745" end="2:01.148">叫</span><span begin="2:01.148" end="2:01.561">ぶ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这样的心情 我会一次次呐喊 / I shout out such a feeling over and over</span></p><p begin="2:01.766" end="2:04.886" itunes:key="L53" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:01.766" end="2:01.951">相</span><span begin="2:01.951" end="2:02.182">容</span><span begin="2:02.182" end="2:02.293">れ</span><span begin="2:02.293" end="2:02.533">な</span><span begin="2:02.533" end="2:02.640">い</span><span begin="2:02.640" end="2:02.841">も</span><span begin="2:02.841" end="2:03.038">の</span><span begin="2:03.038" end="2:03.245">も</span><span begin="2:03.245" end="2:03.606" amll:empty-beat="1">愛</span><span begin="2:03.606" end="2:03.908">せ</span><span begin="2:03.908" end="2:04.018">る</span><span begin="2:04.018" end="2:04.315">ま</span><span begin="2:04.315" end="2:04.500">で</span><span begin="2:04.500" end="2:04.886">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">【志歩】直到连无法相容的事物都能去爱 / Until I can love even the disharmonious things</span></p><p begin="2:05.277" end="2:08.203" itunes:key="L54" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:05.277" end="2:06.190" amll:empty-beat="1">独</span><span begin="2:06.190" end="2:06.387">り</span><span begin="2:06.387" end="2:06.506">か</span><span begin="2:06.506" end="2:06.756">ら</span><span begin="2:06.756" end="2:07.239" a