60" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:15.173" end="2:15.591" amll:empty-beat="1">広</span><span begin="2:15.591" end="2:15.756">が</span><span begin="2:15.756" end="2:16.003">り</span><span begin="2:16.003" end="2:16.456" amll:empty-beat="1">続</span><span begin="2:16.456" end="2:16.589">け</span><span begin="2:16.589" end="2:16.894">る</span><span begin="2:16.894" end="2:17.121">こ</span><span begin="2:17.121" end="2:17.300">の</span><span begin="2:17.300" end="2:17.696" amll:empty-beat="1">想</span><span begin="2:17.696" end="2:17.935">い</span><span begin="2:17.935" end="2:18.296">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">随着这不断扩散的情感 / With this thought that continues to expand</span></p><p begin="2:18.572" end="2:21.625" itunes:key="L61" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:18.572" end="2:19.093" amll:empty-beat="2">私</span><span begin="2:19.093" end="2:19.390">は</span><span begin="2:19.390" end="2:19.860" amll:empty-beat="1">創</span><span begin="2:19.860" end="2:19.953">ら</span><span begin="2:19.953" end="2:20.165">れ､</span><span begin="2:20.165" end="2:20.557" amll:empty-beat="1">創</span><span begin="2:20.557" end="2:20.627">っ</span><span begin="2:20.627" end="2:20.764">て</span><span begin="2:20.764" end="2:20.951">た</span><span begin="2:20.951" end="2:21.092">み</span><span begin="2:21.092" end="2:21.286" amll:empty-beat="1">たい</span><span begin="2:21.286" end="2:21.625">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我似乎既被塑造 亦在主动创造 / I was made, it was like it created me</span></p><p begin="2:21.919" end="2:22.481" itunes:key="L62" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:21.919" end="2:22.023">い</span><span begin="2:22.023" end="2:22.140">つ</span><span begin="2:22.140" end="2:22.316">だっ</span><span begin="2:22.316" end="2:22.481">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">【志歩】无论何时 / Anytime</span></p><p begin="2:22.552" end="2:23.084" itunes:key="L63" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:22.552" end="2:22.689">ど</span><span begin="2:22.689" end="2:22.779">こ</span><span begin="2:22.779" end="2:22.950">だっ</span><span begin="2:22.950" end="2:23.084">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">【穂波】无论何地 / Anywhere</span></p><p begin="2:23.192" end="2:23.785" itunes:key="L64" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:23.192" end="2:23.407" amll:empty-beat="1">誰</span><span begin="2:23.407" end="2:23.530">だっ</span><span begin="2:23.615" end="2:23.785">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">【咲希】无论是谁 / With anyone</span></p><p begin="2:23.833" end="2:24.977" itunes:key="L65" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:23.833" end="2:24.033" amll:empty-beat="1">何</span><span begin="2:24.033" end="2:24.137">度</span><span begin="2:24.137" end="2:24.230">も</span><span begin="2:24.230" end="2:24.475" amll:empty-beat="1">繋</span><span begin="2:24.475" end="2:24.674">がっ</span><span begin="2:24.674" end="2:24.977">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">【MEIKO】我们一次又一次地彼此相连 / I am connected to them again and again</span></p><p begin="2:25.272" end="2:28.361" itunes:key="L66" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:25.272" end="2:25.648" amll:empty-beat="1">「愛</span><span begin="2:25.648" end="2:25.825">し</span><span begin="2:25.825" end="2:26.080">て</span><span begin="2:26.080" end="2:26.241">ほ</span><span begin="2:26.241" end="2:26.462">し</span><span begin="2:26.462" end="2:26.569">い」</span><span begin="2:26.569" end="2:26.693">って</span><span begin="2:26.693" end="2:26.954">やっ</span><span begin="2:26.954" end="2:27.049">と</span><span begin="2:27.049" end="2:27.409" amll:empty-beat="1">口</span><span begin="2:27.409" end="2:27.512">に</span><span begin="2:27.512" end="2:27.592">で</span><span begin="2:27.592" end="2:27.806">き</span><span begin="2:27.806" end="2:28.013">た</span><span begin="2:28.013" end="2:28.361">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">【咲希】终于能开口说出“请爱我吧” / I finally managed to voice that &quot;I want you to love me.&quot;</span></p><p begin="2:28.632" end="2:31.715" itunes:key="L67" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:28.632" end="2:29.022" amll:empty-beat="1">今</span><span begin="2:29.022" end="2:29.177">あ</span><span begin="2:29.177" end="2:29.404">る</span><span begin="2:29.404" end="2:29.928" amll:empty-beat="1">全</span><span begin="2:29.928" end="2:30.028">て</span><span begin="2:30.028" end="2:30.337">を</span><span begin="2:30.337" end="2:30.518">受</span><span begin="2:30.518" end="2:30.740">け</span><span begin="2:30.740" end="2:30.848">取</span><span begin="2:30.848" end="2:31.138">る</span><span begin="2:31.138" end="2:31.376">か</span><span begin="2:31.376" end="2:31.715">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">【一歌】因为我已经能接受现在所有的一切 / Because I take in everything in this moment</span></p><p begin="2:32.005" end="2:35.058" itunes:key="L68" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:32.005" end="2:32.526" amll:empty-beat="2">私</span><span begin="2:32.526" end="2:32.817">の</span><span begin="2:32.817" end="2:33.041">気</span><span begin="2:33.041" end="2:33.220">持</span><span begin="2:33.220" end="2:33.341">ち</span><span begin="2:33.341" end="2:33.674">も</span><span begin="2:33.674" end="2:33.888">受</span><span begin="2:33.888" end="2:34.062">け</span><span begin="2:34.062" end="2:34.215">止</span><span begin="2:34.215" end="2:34.407">め</span><span begin="2:34.407" end="2:34.490">て､</span><span begin="2:34.490" end="2:34.702" amll:empty-beat="1">ずっ</span><span begin="2:34.702" end="2:35.058">と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以也请接纳我的心意 直到永远 / I&apos;ll accept my feelings too, all the way</span></p><p begin="2:35.306" end="2:35.918" itunes:key="L69" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:35.306" end="2:35.436">吐</span><span begin="2:35.436" end="2:35.571">き</span><span begin="2:35.571" end="2:35.680">出</span><span begin="2:35.680" end="2:35.770">し</span><span begin="2:35.770" end="2:35.918">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">【穂波】尽情倾诉 / Though I&apos;ll spit it out</span></p><p begin="2:35.969" end="2:36.455" itunes:key