:42.230" end="2:42.464">ん</span><span begin="2:42.464" end="2:43.789">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">【MEIKO】伴随着至今的旋律 我将继续生存下去 / The sound of the past and me will continue to live</span></p><p begin="2:55.057" end="3:01.968" itunes:key="L74" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:55.057" end="2:55.275">こ</span><span begin="2:55.275" end="2:55.442">の</span><span begin="2:55.442" end="2:55.667">セ</span><span begin="2:55.667" end="2:56.349">カ</span><span begin="2:56.349" end="2:56.532">イ</span><span begin="2:56.532" end="2:57.001">が</span> <span begin="2:57.184" end="2:58.231" amll:empty-beat="2">私</span><span begin="2:58.231" end="2:58.568">は</span><span begin="2:58.850" end="2:59.379">大</span><span begin="2:59.379" end="2:59.680">好</span><span begin="2:59.680" end="3:00.111">き</span><span begin="3:00.111" end="3:00.525">な</span><span begin="3:00.525" end="3:00.709">だ</span><span begin="3:00.709" end="3:01.370">け</span><span begin="3:01.370" end="3:01.467">な</span><span begin="3:01.467" end="3:01.580">の</span><span begin="3:01.580" end="3:01.968">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">【一歌】对于这个SEKAI 明明只是怀揣着最纯粹的爱意 / I love this SEKAI so much, yet</span></p><p begin="3:02.200" end="3:05.298" itunes:key="L75" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="3:02.200" end="3:02.646" amll:empty-beat="1">歪</span><span begin="3:02.646" end="3:02.746">ん</span><span begin="3:02.746" end="3:03.047">で</span><span begin="3:03.047" end="3:03.261">行</span><span begin="3:03.261" end="3:03.458">く</span> <span begin="3:03.693" end="3:04.114" amll:empty-beat="1">流</span><span begin="3:04.114" end="3:04.323">れ</span><span begin="3:04.323" end="3:04.435">を</span><span begin="3:04.435" end="3:04.903" amll:empty-beat="1">正</span><span begin="3:04.903" end="3:05.298">す</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">【MEIKO】却发现它在一点点扭曲 试图纠正偏离的洪流 / The flow is getting distorted</span></p><p begin="3:05.502" end="3:08.665" itunes:key="L76" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="3:05.502" end="3:05.682">そ</span><span begin="3:05.682" end="3:05.805">れ</span><span begin="3:05.805" end="3:05.979">は</span><span begin="3:05.979" end="3:06.535" amll:empty-beat="1">難</span><span begin="3:06.535" end="3:06.686">し</span><span begin="3:06.686" end="3:06.833">い</span><span begin="3:06.833" end="3:06.939">こ</span><span begin="3:06.939" end="3:07.106">と</span><span begin="3:07.106" end="3:07.228">っ</span><span begin="3:07.228" end="3:07.447">て</span><span begin="3:07.447" end="3:07.652">感</span><span begin="3:07.652" end="3:07.779">じ</span><span begin="3:07.779" end="3:08.091">る</span><span begin="3:08.091" end="3:08.202">け</span><span begin="3:08.202" end="3:08.315">れ</span><span begin="3:08.315" end="3:08.665">ど</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虽知此事艰难 / And correcting it feels like such a difficult thing, but still</span></p><p begin="3:08.895" end="3:15.267" itunes:key="L77" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:08.895" end="3:09.989" amll:empty-beat="2">私</span><span begin="3:09.989" end="3:10.372">は</span><span begin="3:10.586" end="3:10.806">あ</span><span begin="3:10.806" end="3:11.401">な</span><span begin="3:11.401" end="3:11.640">た</span><span begin="3:11.640" end="3:11.998">と</span><span begin="3:12.283" end="3:12.886" amll:empty-beat="1">同</span><span begin="3:12.886" end="3:13.112">じ</span><span begin="3:13.112" end="3:13.308">よ</span><span begin="3:13.308" end="3:13.545">う</span><span begin="3:13.545" end="3:13.959">に</span><span begin="3:13.959" end="3:14.279" amll:empty-beat="1">愛</span><span begin="3:14.279" end="3:14.365">し</span><span begin="3:14.365" end="3:14.590">て</span><span begin="3:14.590" end="3:14.806">い</span><span begin="3:14.806" end="3:15.267">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">【一歌】但我仍然像你一样去爱着 / I love them in the same way as you</span></p><p begin="3:15.395" end="3:17.102" itunes:key="L78" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="3:15.395" end="3:15.831">こ</span><span begin="3:15.831" end="3:16.422">の</