nd="3:54.479">こ</span><span begin="3:54.479" end="3:54.623">の</span><span begin="3:54.623" end="3:54.757">セ</span><span begin="3:54.757" end="3:55.081">カ</span><span begin="3:55.081" end="3:55.280">イ</span><span begin="3:55.280" end="3:55.521">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">【全员】在这永恒闪耀的SEKAI里 / In this SEKAI that continues to shine</span></p><p begin="3:55.894" end="3:58.938" itunes:key="L94" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:55.894" end="3:56.414" amll:empty-beat="2">私</span><span begin="3:56.414" end="3:56.709">は</span><span begin="3:56.709" end="3:56.969">惹</span><span begin="3:56.969" end="3:57.168">か</span><span begin="3:57.168" end="3:57.286">れ</span><span begin="3:57.286" end="3:57.568">て</span><span begin="3:57.568" end="3:57.873" amll:empty-beat="1">光</span><span begin="3:57.873" end="3:57.995">っ</span><span begin="3:57.995" end="3:58.128">てい</span><span begin="3:58.128" end="3:58.310">た</span><span begin="3:58.310" end="3:58.427">み</span><span begin="3:58.427" end="3:58.649" amll:empty-beat="1">たい</span><span begin="3:58.649" end="3:58.938">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我似乎被吸引着 也在发光着 / I was drawn to that song, seems like it was shining</span></p><p begin="3:59.282" end="3:59.819" itunes:key="L95" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="3:59.282" end="3:59.492" amll:empty-beat="1">高</span><span begin="3:59.492" end="3:59.706">鳴っ</span><span begin="3:59.706" end="3:59.819">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">【志歩】“曾有首歌 / That</span></p><p begin="3:59.819" end="4:00.480" itunes:key="L96" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="3:59.819" end="4:00.006" amll:empty-beat="1">歌</span><span begin="4:00.006" end="4:00.111">が</span><span begin="4:00.111" end="4:00.310">あっ</span><span begin="4:00.310" end="4:00.480">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">【MEIKO】让我心潮激荡 / Heart-throbbing song</span></p><p begin="4:00.480" end="4:01.058" itunes:key="L97" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="4:00.480" end="4:00.614" amll:empty-beat="1">嬉</span><span begin="4:00.614" end="4:00.745">し</span><span begin="4:00.745" end="4:00.941" amll:empty-beat="1">かっ</span><span begin="4:00.941" end="4:01.058">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">【穂波】那时光如此欢畅” / Makes me so happy</span></p><p begin="4:01.058" end="4:02.292" itunes:key="L98" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="4:01.058" end="4:01.355" amll:empty-beat="2">私</span><span begin="4:01.355" end="4:01.532" amll:empty-beat="1">達､</span><span begin="4:01.532" end="4:01.774" amll:empty-beat="1">繋</span><span begin="4:01.774" end="4:02.007">がっ</span><span begin="4:02.007" end="4:02.292">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">【咲希】“我们，心意相通” / We are connected to each other</span></p><p begin="4:02.611" end="4:05.702" itunes:key="L99" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:02.611" end="4:02.974">等</span><span begin="4:02.974" end="4:03.154">し</span><span begin="4:03.154" end="4:03.471">く</span><span begin="4:03.471" end="4:04.004" amll:empty-beat="2">輝</span><span begin="4:04.004" end="4:04.232">く</span><span begin="4:04.232" end="4:04.529">ス</span><span begin="4:04.529" end="4:04.696" amll:empty-beat="1">ター</span><span begin="4:04.696" end="4:04.846">を</span><span begin="4:04.846" end="4:05.151">持っ</span><span begin="4:05.151" end="4:05.224">て</span><span begin="4:05.224" end="4:05.352">い</span><span begin="4:05.352" end="4:05.702">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">【一歌】我们都拥有同样璀璨的星 / Each of us was holding an equally shining star</span></p><p begin="4:05.921" end="4:09.002" itunes:key="L100" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:05.921" end="4:06.379">暗</span><span begin="4:06.379" end="4:06.830" amll:empty-beat="1">闇</span><span begin="4:06.830" end="4:07.051">で</span><span begin="4:07.051" end="4:07.240">目</span><span begin="4:07.240" end="4:07.320">立</span><span begin="4:07.320" end="4:07.682">つ</span><span begin="4:07.682" end="4:07.891">よ</span><span begin="4:07.891" end="4:08.077">り</span><span begin="4:08.077" end="4:08.727" amll:empty-beat="2">私</span><span begin="4:08.727" end="4:09.002">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">【全员】比起在黑暗中显眼 / Rather than standing out in the darkness</span></p><p begin="4:09.290" end="4:12.371" itunes:key="L101" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:09.290" end="4:09.569">世</span><span begin="4:09.569" end="4:09.892" amll:empty-beat="1">界</span><span begin="4:09.892" end="4:10.180">の</span><span begin="4:10.180" end="4:10.377">真</span><span begin="4:10.377" end="4:10.557">ん</span><span begin="4:10.557" end="4:11.000" amll:empty-beat="1">中</span><span begin="4:11.000" end="4:11.116">で</span><span begin="4:11.116" end="4:11.463" amll:empty-beat="1">星</span><span begin="4:11.463" end="4:11.547">に</span><span begin="4:11.547" end="4:11.763">な</span><span begin="4:11.763" end="4:11.871">り</span><span begin="4:11.871" end="4:12.069">た</span><span begin="4:12.069" end="4:12.371">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我更愿成为世界中央的一颗星 / I wanna be a star in the center of this world</span></p><p begin="4:12.685" end="4:13.244" itunes:key="L102" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="4:12.685" end="4:12.897">大</span><span begin="4:12.897" end="4:13.132">丈</span><span begin="4:13.132" end="4:13.244">夫</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">【MEIKO×穂波】没关系 / So don&apos;t worry</span></p><p begin="4:13.244" end="4:13.949" itunes:key="L103" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="4:13.244" end="4:13.424" amll:empty-beat="1">忘</span><span begin="4:13.424" end="4:13.547">れ</span><span begin="4:13.547" end="4:13.649">な</span><span begin="4:13.649" end="4:13.761">い</span><span begin="4:13.761" end="4:13.949">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">【MEIKO×咲希×志歩】我不会忘记的 / I won&apos;t forget it</span></p><p begin="4:13.949" end="4:14.511" itunes:key="L104" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="4:13.949" end="4:14.066" amll:empty-beat="1">一</span><span begin="4:14.066" end="4:14.398">生</span><span begin="4:14.398" end="4